WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.904
The Lane–Emden conjecture.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.811
The critical hyperbola. Below it, conjecturally, no

3
00:00:05.811 --> 00:00:08.391
positive solution exists in any dimension.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.505
Assume a solution; a virial identity bounds

5
00:00:11.505 --> 00:00:14.010
its energy, and dilating breaks the bound.

6
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:17.527
Claimed: no positive solution, in every dimension.

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.427
Main theorem Lean-checked.
